# G8 (text): the mouse in the dialogs of the text screen, one click at a time, each by the cell it is drawn at. About: a click off its
# button does nothing and OK closes it. Replace: the two fields take the focus, a check box ticks, Replace All, Find Next and Close
# press. Spelling: a suggestion is chosen by a click and a button presses. Fonts and Tabs (the form dialogs): a row takes the focus, a
# check box ticks and OK presses. The question on Exit: Cancel, No and Yes press.
@copy plain.qld
@copy en_ca.dic
@open PLAIN.QLD
@click 65 0                   # Help menu
@click 66 3                   # About Quill...
@click 5 20                   # off the box: nothing
@click 34 16                  # OK
@click 22 0                   # Find menu
@click 24 4                   # Replace...
@click 24 10                  # Find what
Q u i l l s
@click 24 11                  # Replace with
p e n s
@click 12 12                  # Match case
@click 40 14                  # Replace All
@click 25 14                  # Replace
@click 12 14                  # Find Next
@click 57 14                  # Close
@click 22 0
@click 24 6                   # Spelling...
@click 17 13                  # the suggestion
@click 32 18                  # Change: the word is changed and the next one shown
@click 66 18                  # Cancel
@click 28 0                   # Character menu
@click 30 12                  # Fonts...
@click 12 12                  # Bold: ticked
@click 12 16                  # OK
@click 40 0                   # Paragraph menu
@click 42 16                  # Tabs...
@click 12 11                  # Kind: the next kind
@click 12 12                  # Leader: the next leader
@click 24 10                  # Position
1 period 5
@click 12 13                  # Set
@click 12 16                  # Close
x
@click 3 0
@click 5 12                   # Exit: the question
@click 45 12                  # Cancel
@click 3 0
@click 5 12
@click 31 12                  # No: Quill ends
